<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-1484-12-1-2020-learning-object-metadata> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An IEEE standard defining the conceptual data schema for metadata that describes learning objects, including characteristics such as lifecycle, educational use, technical requirements, rights, relationships, annotations, and classifications." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-1484-12-1-2020-learning-object-metadata/versions/1> .
