<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-1484-12-1-2020-learning-object-metadata> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "LOM provides a common descriptive model that helps learning technology systems manage, locate, evaluate, exchange, and potentially automate the selection of learning resources." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-1484-12-1-2020-learning-object-metadata/versions/1> .
